1. sort the strengths and give the $i$-th smallest ($i = 1, \ldots, n$) the failure probability $F_i = (i - 0.5)/n$;
2. fit a straight line $y = mx + c$ with $x = \ln\sigma$ and $y = \ln[-\ln(1 - F)]$;
3. return `(m, sigma0)` with $\sigma_0 = e^{-c/m}$.

